    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fateful showdown is coming\u2014get ready to examine your skills as the crafty, pint-sized Capsy locks horns with the ruthless power of Thornark.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Capsy</strong> \u2014 a charming yet slightly cheeky capsule with a moustache and a stylish shower cap. Sounds weird? It does! But hey, don\u2019t judge a capsule by its cap. This is a <strong>hardcore platformer</strong> filled entirely with action, where every jump or shot could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level grants you just <strong>3 lives</strong> and a couple of <strong>extra attempts</strong> before you\u2019re unceremoniously booted back to the main menu. Yep, you heard that right: if you slip up, prepare to feel the burning butt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worried about going in unarmed? Relax. There's an <strong>arsenal of weapons</strong> ready to match every playstyle and taste. Just a heads-up\u2014handle them with care, because while they can blast away the foes, they\u2019re just as likely to put an untimely end to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But wait, there\u2019s more than just guns. You\u2019ve also got a suite of cool abilities: <strong>a trusty hook, a bullet jump, circle shooting</strong>, and a few surprises waiting to be discovered. Sounds awesome? Then it\u2019s time to check them out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels, collect <strong>rare items</strong>, and get set for moments when you\u2019ll become something <strong>more than just a capsule with a moustache</strong>. Capsoul isn\u2019t for the faint of heart\u2014it's built for gamers who crave a challenge, have a good aim, and don\u2019t mind clashing with the same boss a dozen times over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you brave enough to dive in and show the world what you\u2019re made of?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fateful showdown is coming\u2014get ready to examine your skills as the crafty, pint-sized Capsy locks horns with the ruthless power of Thornark.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Capsy</strong> \u2014 a charming yet slightly cheeky capsule with a moustache and a stylish shower cap. Sounds weird? It does! But hey, don\u2019t judge a capsule by its cap. This is a <strong>hardcore platformer</strong> filled entirely with action, where every jump or shot could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level grants you just <strong>3 lives</strong> and a couple of <strong>extra attempts</strong> before you\u2019re unceremoniously booted back to the main menu. Yep, you heard that right: if you slip up, prepare to feel the burning butt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worried about going in unarmed? Relax. There's an <strong>arsenal of weapons</strong> ready to match every playstyle and taste. Just a heads-up\u2014handle them with care, because while they can blast away the foes, they\u2019re just as likely to put an untimely end to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But wait, there\u2019s more than just guns. You\u2019ve also got a suite of cool abilities: <strong>a trusty hook, a bullet jump, circle shooting</strong>, and a few surprises waiting to be discovered. Sounds awesome? Then it\u2019s time to check them out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels, collect <strong>rare items</strong>, and get set for moments when you\u2019ll become something <strong>more than just a capsule with a moustache</strong>. Capsoul isn\u2019t for the faint of heart\u2014it's built for gamers who crave a challenge, have a good aim, and don\u2019t mind clashing with the same boss a dozen times over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you brave enough to dive in and show the world what you\u2019re made of?</p>",
